<title>UK: Bookmaker takes 50,000 stg bets on Labour victory.</title>
<headline>Bookmaker takes 50,000 stg bets on Labour victory.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bookmaker Coral said on Friday it had taken 50,000 pounds in the past week in bets on a Labour victory in the May 1 election, but said Labour's odds on winning were unchanged at 1-7.</p>
<p>Odds on a Conservatives victory were also unchanged at 4-1.</p>
<p>Coral said its odds on Labour winning an overall majority were 2-9, while prospects for a hung parliament were at 9-2.</p>
